<title>USA: OHSL Financial to buy back up to 10 pct shr.</title>
<headline>OHSL Financial to buy back up to 10 pct shr.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI, Ohio 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>OHSL Financial Corp said Thursday that it will repurchase up to 10 percent of its outstanding shares in the open market beginning on or after November 1.</p>
<p>The company said it would hold the repurchased shares as treasury shares.</p>
<p>The buyback would be its fourth repurchase program since OHSL became a publicly-traded company in 1993, the company said.</p>
</text>
